@startuml
!theme blueprint
skinparam dpi 280
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei UI
skinparam activityBorderColor black
skinparam arrowColor black
skinparam arrowFontColor black
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor black
skinparam activityDiamondFontColor white
skinparam activityBarColor black
!option handwritten false
'title ADC 采样流程

start
:原始 ADC 值 (0-4095);
:三次采样平均\nraw0 + raw1 + raw2 / 3\n降低瞬时噪声;
:电压校准转换\nesp_adc_cal_raw_to_voltage()\nADC → mV (0-3300);
:死区处理 5%\nminV + 5% range\nmaxV - 5% range\n消除抖动;
:范围映射\n校准范围 → 0-255\npct = (vol - min) / (max - min)\nvalue = 255 * pct;
:EMA 平滑滤波\n自适应指数移动平均\nα = 0.7 (大变化) 快速跟随\nα = 0.2 (小抖动) 平滑处理;
:步进限幅\n单次最大变化 12\nmaxStep = 12\n防止过快跳变;
:输出值 (0-255);
stop

@enduml